{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136240/extras/ac0ff8c8e0d916fa60908f6bbec74309.poster.avif?t=1771451902\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136240/extras/ac0ff8c8e0d916fa60908f6bbec74309.webm?t=1771451902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136240/extras/ac0ff8c8e0d916fa60908f6bbec74309.mp4?t=1771451902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lead your country to prosperity.</strong>\u00a0Place towns at strategic points, connect them and watch them grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inspired by RimWorld's and Prison Architect's emergent chaos</strong>, but for an entire country. Random events will test your infrastructure. Wars are small-scale. The real enemy is logistics, economics, and keeping your citizens from revolting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136240/extras/34e2c7c7f812ae980824fe355588f343.poster.avif?t=1771451902\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136240/extras/34e2c7c7f812ae980824fe355588f343.webm?t=1771451902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136240/extras/34e2c7c7f812ae980824fe355588f343.mp4?t=1771451902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design infrastructure blueprints</strong>, then <strong>select from bidding teams</strong>: each with different skills, vehicles and costs. Roads and power lines degrade over time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices have long-term consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage teams of builders and defenders. They need fuel, can gain experience, and can be customized with different vehicle types and configurations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your citizens are watching.</strong>\u00a0Towns generate feedback through Social Bird, a procedurally-generated citizen commentary system that reflects local conditions, history, and problems. Ignore the warnings, and you'll face civil unrest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136240/extras/d71dc7761658a78e47c49e66f906a99e.poster.avif?t=1771451902\" width=1170 height=341 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136240/extras/d71dc7761658a78e47c49e66f906a99e.webm?t=1771451902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mine resources and build factories</strong> to advance the economy. Form trade routes to strengthen the GDP and international prestige. Keep an eye on the budget deficit, you don't want to enter a recession!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4136240?t=1771451902","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4136240?t=1771451902","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136240/33cacd841660048ddd01093068e6d844132d103e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771451902","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136240/33cacd841660048ddd01093068e6d844132d103e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771451902","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136240/extras/ac0ff8c8e0d916fa60908f6bbec74309.poster.avif?t=1771451902\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136240/extras/ac0ff8c8e0d916fa60908f6bbec74309.webm?t=1771451902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136240/extras/ac0ff8c8e0d916fa60908f6bbec74309.mp4?t=1771451902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lead your country to prosperity.</strong>\u00a0Place towns at strategic points, connect them and watch them grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inspired by RimWorld's and Prison Architect's emergent chaos</strong>, but for an entire country. Random events will test your infrastructure. Wars are small-scale. The real enemy is logistics, economics, and keeping your citizens from revolting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136240/extras/34e2c7c7f812ae980824fe355588f343.poster.avif?t=1771451902\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136240/extras/34e2c7c7f812ae980824fe355588f343.webm?t=1771451902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136240/extras/34e2c7c7f812ae980824fe355588f343.mp4?t=1771451902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design infrastructure blueprints</strong>, then <strong>select from bidding teams</strong>: each with different skills, vehicles and costs. Roads and power lines degrade over time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices have long-term consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage teams of builders and defenders. They need fuel, can gain experience, and can be customized with different vehicle types and configurations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your citizens are watching.</strong>\u00a0Towns generate feedback through Social Bird, a procedurally-generated citizen commentary system that reflects local conditions, history, and problems. Ignore the warnings, and you'll face civil unrest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136240/extras/d71dc7761658a78e47c49e66f906a99e.poster.avif?t=1771451902\" width=1170 height=341 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136240/extras/d71dc7761658a78e47c49e66f906a99e.webm?t=1771451902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mine resources and build factories</strong> to advance the economy. Form trade routes to strengthen the GDP and international prestige. Keep an eye on the budget deficit, you don't want to enter a recession!</p>","developers":["purple_mimosa"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136240/27fc3e9f0f3664912085e644047d5c26252f9faa/header.jpg?t=1771451902","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Any modern distro with glibc 2.31+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 @ 3.7GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.3 compatible GPU<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Linux support is in active development. System requirements are estimated and may change.</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4460 @ 3.2GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 960 / AMD equivalent with Mesa 22.0+</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Country Architect","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 @ 3.7GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4460 @ 3.2GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 960 2GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":true,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Tribesylvania Studios"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"To be announced"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136240/14ac3680702e5bb1a2bfadf71e37123c7b80e597/ss_14ac3680702e5bb1a2bfadf71e37123c7b80e597.1920x1080.jpg?t=1771451902","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136240/14ac3680702e5bb1a2bfadf71e37123c7b80e597/ss_14ac3680702e5bb1a2bfadf71e37123c7b80e597.600x338.jpg?t=1771451902"},{"id"